{"schema_version":"d_pc_direction_full_review_cover_patch_round2_v1","steam_appid":"4511760","display_title":"龙城传奇","sources":{"player":{"label":"普通玩家","readable_count":27,"empty_status_count":0,"reviews":[{"id":"p001","recommendation":"推荐","text":"只要职业平衡，玩着就是爽！而且有很多跨服玩法值得期待","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198980827776/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p002","recommendation":"推荐","text":"适合长期玩，版本节奏比较慢","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198793697284/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p003","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法很别致，在技能上有了突破与创新，特别是终极技能，每个职业都有自己的特色","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199714866978/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p004","recommendation":"推荐","text":"三职业版本好玩，因为有差异性，就有策略性","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198741896036/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p005","recommendation":"推荐","text":"新上的传奇，玩法不错，画面不错，战斗体验很棒","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199702387749/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p006","recommendation":"推荐","text":"玩法比较多样，特别期待后面的跨服大战","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199715047465/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p007","recommendation":"推荐","text":"垃圾游戏 刷怪资源慢 圈钱游戏 不花钱 转生都难","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199584735796/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p008","recommendation":"推荐","text":"这爆率真的一言难尽，低的充钱欲望都没有","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/id/740583433/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p009","recommendation":"推荐","text":"比较适合长期玩，玩法与内容量比较丰富","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198980963590/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p010","recommendation":"推荐","text":"比较独特的玩法 结合传奇的风格，打造了自己的特色玩法","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198793721881/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p011","recommendation":"不推荐","text":"唯一一个还算能勉强玩的下去的传奇，不过慢慢玩着玩着也没意思了，不好意思，还是得给你差评","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961222229/recommended/4511760/"},{"id":"p012","recommendation":"推荐","text":"很不错，内容量居多，可以玩的时间特别丰富","url":"https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198738059